    Bug 1995205 - Clean up preference set in browser_messageCommandsArchive.js. r=aleca
    The setting of this value caused browser_recentMenu.js to archive a message in an unexpected
    location, and then not be able to find it.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D269170

